  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05627-000:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfInvestmentSecuritiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;※５　投資有価証券売却益&lt;/p&gt;
